  "description": {
   "en": "A 6-book dojinshi mook series by CLAMP. Each book consists of manga and text Short stories.\n\nList of stories:\nShoten  1:\n1. となりのいんど人 (Apapa Mokona, 17p)\n2. 302号室の変人 (Mick Nekoi, 4p)\n3. カルラ舞う! (Tamayo Akiyama, 5p)\n1. RG VEDA外伝 (Sei Nanao, 10p)\n3. 日常茶飯事I (Leeza Sei, 1p)\n4. 日常茶飯事II (Leeza Sei, 1p)\n5. 青年の末来 ([Short story] Text: Satsuki Igarashi, Illustration: Tamayo Akiyama, 7p)\n6. 誕生日 (Shinya Ohmi, 2p)\n7. 101号室の住人 (Mick Nekoi, 4p)\n1. 人生いろいろ (O-Kyon, 2p)\n1. [Illustration] (Shinya Ohmi)\n1. Y'S (Tamayo Akiyama, 3p)\n1. [Illustration] (Shinya Ohmi)\n8. ウィ一クエンドスクランブル (Leeza Sei, 48p)\n9. 初恋/はつこい ([Short story] Text: Kazue Nakamori, Illustration: 福本睦 Mutsumi Fukumoto, 14p)\n10. PASSENGER! (Soshi Hisagi, 8p)\n1. PASSENGER 番外編1 (Soshi Hisagi, 1p)\n1. PASSENGER 番外編2 (Soshi Hisagi, 1p)\n1. 妹之山家の一族 ([Short story] Original story: CLAMP42年組 CLAMP 42 Nen Gumi, Text: Ohkawa Nanase, Illustration: Leeza Sei/Sei Nanao/Apapa Mokona, 26p)\n1. 妹之山家の一族 NG (CLAMP 42 Nen Gumi, 2p)\n1. SECRECY (CLAMP 42 Nen Gumi, 6p)\n\nShoten  2:\n\n1. Roses and Non-Fiction (Apapa Mokona, 22p)\n1. 一途な夜 無傷な朝 (Soshi Hisagi, 16p)\n1. [Illustration] (Shinya Ohmi)\n1. WHAT A WOUNDERFUL WORLD ([Short story] Ohkawa Nanase, 12p)\n1. [Illustration] (Reissue of ch. 11) (Shinya Ohmi)\n1. PARADOX MARCH (Sei Nanao, 22p)\n1. 日常茶飯事 (Reissue of ch. 5-6) (Leeza Sei, 2p)\n1. リフレイン (Tamayo Akiyama, 23p)\n1. 人生いろいろ (Reissue of ch. 10) (O-Kyon, 2p)\n1. 今夜だけきっと ([Short story] Satsuki Igarashi, 4p)\n1. 星のオルゴール (Mick Nekoi, 18p)\n1. LOVEさりげなく ([Short story] Kazue Nakamori, 15p)\n1. いつのまにか (Leeza Sei, 55p)\n\nShoten 3 - Into a Movie:\n\n1. 妖獣都市 (Leeza Sei, 63p)\n1. 仁義なき戦い (Apapa Mokona, 16p)\n1. 博士の異常な愛情 ([Short Story] Satsuki Igarashi, 6p)\n1. アパートの鍵貸します (Sei Nanao, 30p)\n1. CHILD (Tamayo Akiyama, 32p)\n1. HATARI! (Mick Nekoi, 30p)\n1. THE STING/スティング ([Short Story] Ohkawa Nanase, 34p)\n\nShoten (3.5) in Separate Volume:\n\n1. I CAN BE ([Short Story] Ohkawa Nanase, 2p)\n1. ウララ (Apapa Mokona, 6p)\n1. FANKY STAR (Mick Nekoi, 7p)\n1. 浪漫飛行 (Sei Nanao, 5p)\n1. Party Joke ([Short Story] Satsuki Igarashi, 4p)\n1. Sure Dance (Tamayo Akiyama, 11p)\n1. PARODIES (Leeza Sei, 9p)\n\nShoten 4 - I WANNA BE A ONLY ONE:\n\n1. 砂漠のさかな/DESERT FISH - I WANNA BE A ONLY ONE (Apapa Mokona, 30p)\n1. 月下夜行/UNDER THE MOON LIGHT DANCEING (Mick Nekoi, 16p)\n1. 手の中の月 (Sei Nanao, 32p)\n1. 夢から醒めた夢/DREAM COME TRUE (Mick Nekoi, 20p)\n1. 青春のあやまち/YOUT IN MISTAKE ([Short Story] Satsuki Igarashi, 10p)\n1. Twilight Square (Tamayo Akiyama, 34p)\n1. STING 2 ([Short Story] Ohkawa Nanase, 32p)\n1. JUST A LITTLE BIT - STING 3 (Leeza Sei, 40p)\n1. 凍空 (Leeza Sei, 16p)\n\nShoten 5:\n\n1. SHINING STAR (Apapa Mokona, 24p) [Manga updates](https://www.mangaupdates.com/series/yql1tm1/shining-star-clamp)\n1. 僕の君 (Mick Nekoi, 4p)\n1. 白昼の死角/DEAD ANGLE OF DAYTIME (Tamayo Akiyama, 34p)\n1. 君のそばで会おう (Sei Nanao, 34p)\n1. 愛してるなんてとても言えない ([Short Story] Satsuki Igarashi, 10p)\n1. 半分の過去 (Mick Nekoi, 34p)\n1. ONE FINE MESS (Leeza Sei, 44p)\n1. 日本妖怪巡礼団 (\"Tokyo Babylon prototype\"[Short Story] Ohkawa Nanase, 19p)\n\nShoten 6 - FINAL:\n\n1. 君に一番近い場所 (Apapa Mokona, 34p)\n1. 不可分的存在 (Mick Nekoi, 10p)\n1. Asian Paradise (Sei Nanao, 34p)\n1. 月下迷宮/MAZE OF MOON (Mick Nekoi, 18p)\n1. ちょっとしたこと ([Short Story] Satsuki Igarashi, 10p)\n1. Once upon a Time (Leeza Sei, 18p)\n1. 覚醒ない想い (Mick Nekoi, 18p)\n1. LAST TIME (Tamayo Akiyama, 36p)\n1. 53億分の偶然 (Leeza Sei, 36p)\n1. 東京 BABYLON (\"Tokyo Babylon prototype\" [Short Story] Ohkawa Nanase, 16p)"
  },
